    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c56c5b67536dc9702f4d38f95a11b5fc.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c56c5b67536dc9702f4d38f95a11b5fc.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the quirky town of Larcenest Gap. Take pictures with your camera and write articles in your journal. Interact with the people who have daily routines and help them with their various tasks. Use your investigating skills to unravel the mystery surrounding this town.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/69fcaffdf6961d063ebc78433edea368.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/69fcaffdf6961d063ebc78433edea368.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/73e0533512736afebde7d1cea6a2c9db.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/73e0533512736afebde7d1cea6a2c9db.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander through an open world full of life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around every corner there are strange sights, and cozy moments waiting to be found. From mysterious forests to quirky city streets, every area in Larcenest Gap is handcrafted for curious players who love to explore, snap photos, and uncover hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/d794888c790f14bdf6c0c67f7b57640b.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/d794888c790f14bdf6c0c67f7b57640b.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c14613cfa0fc695e6505256127f3b149.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/c14613cfa0fc695e6505256127f3b149.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Something\u2019s off in Larcenest Gap.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new journalist in town, you\u2019re here to find the truth. Investigate hidden mysteries that go beyond your job description and help the locals solve their bizarre problems. Your choices shape the world you live in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/62f709f63de13f48f1a27e8dfcd3aa04.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/62f709f63de13f48f1a27e8dfcd3aa04.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/cb934ac05a605feb9adc2e729c6950b9.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/cb934ac05a605feb9adc2e729c6950b9.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Your choices shape the town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every quest you complete lets you choose one out of three article styles. The article you publish will change how the world reacts, from the gossip on the town\u2019s quest board to how areas look and feel. The townsfolk remember what you write\u2026 and sometimes even dress the part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/0d029fec493a2f047b0dd77b3d05c74c.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/0d029fec493a2f047b0dd77b3d05c74c.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/51c9f84829bc854ce3d1f721877133e4.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/51c9f84829bc854ce3d1f721877133e4.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn strange encounters into cozy collectibles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock stickers by photographing weird moments, completing quests, and exploring hidden areas. Use the stickers to decorate your journal to reflect your creativity, turning it into a masterpiece or an evidence board. It\u2019s all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/553ff1e9f99d26ee480af53ae8931107.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=103 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/553ff1e9f99d26ee480af53ae8931107.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/911b2018505cbcefeb5335313cc3e3f9.poster.avif?t=1755672345\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/911b2018505cbcefeb5335313cc3e3f9.webm?t=1755672345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Time passes\u2026 and the world changes with it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world under the warm sun or the eerie glow of moonlight. Certain events, characters, and secrets only appear at specific times, so keep your camera ready and eyes open.</p>",
